                       UI/API                    DOMAIN
                         │                           │
                         ▼                           ▼
                       React                   Pure TS logic
```

The architecture should make boundaries obvious:

```txt
Who owns it?       → Feature
Does it need React? → Hook
Is it business logic? → Pure function
Is it remote I/O?   → Service
Is it shared state? → Store/server-state layer
Is it navigation state? → URL
Does it cross domains? → Workflow/composition layer
Is it truly generic? → Shared
```

When in doubt, prefer the smallest abstraction that preserves the correct ownership boundary.
